      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Food Delivery Application System Design\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Food Delivery Application System Design\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_w1scGHO1Bx2739I21mPY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 180.18939728438852,
      "y": 313.24936973064405,
      "width": 1066.043701171875,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 951631216,
      "version": 286,
      "versionNonce": 582632848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790675426679,
      "created": 1790667081091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Design Online platform Application like Zomato/ Swiggy /Uber eats\n- Platform allow users to search restaurants and order food online from them",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Design Online platform Application like Zomato/ Swiggy /Uber eats\n- Platform allow users to search restaurants and order food online from them",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EUJZmDorfj3-oPO9nkj1S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -57.81060271561148,
      "y": 446.24936973064405,
      "width": 1075.9870393880215,
      "height": 208.99999999999997,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1099845520,
      "version": 910,
      "versionNonce": 824351600,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790675426679,
      "created": 1790667131638,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n- User should able to register\n- List down all the nearby restaurants based on user location\n- User should able to search restaurant based on title and menu\n- Shows all the menu in the display of the restaurants\n- User should able to select various items in the cart and make the payment to confirm order from nearest restaurant\n- Once the restaurant accept, find nearby delivery partner based in driver location, optimised delivery time\n- Once delivery partner pickup the order, give almost real time location of delivery partner to user \n- User should get notification on all stages and get view past orders in the profile",
      "fontSize": 18.577777777777804,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n- User should able to register\n- List down all the nearby restaurants based on user location\n- User should able to search restaurant based on title and menu\n- Shows all the menu in the display of the restaurants\n- User should able to select various items in the cart and make the payment to confirm order from nearest restaurant\n- Once the restaurant accept, find nearby delivery partner based in driver location, optimised delivery time\n- Once delivery partner pickup the order, give almost real time location of delivery partner to user \n- User should get notification on all stages and get view past orders in the profile",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4b6C6JFVJl9pMFPJqb_u_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -51.000513604283356,
      "y": 701.249369730644,
      "width": 839.159423828125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 818556272,
      "version": 720,
      "versionNonce": 467537808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790675417434,
      "created": 1790667160358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non-Functional Requirements\n- Scale : 50M user, 1 million restaurants\n- CAP theorem : App should High available based on search\n   and should high consistent based on payments and order of food from restaurant. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non-Functional Requirements\n- Scale : 50M user, 1 million restaurants\n- CAP theorem : App should High available based on search\n   and should high consistent based on payments and order of food from restaurant. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BdQ3ZIdYuF9qFZdGlsxXF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 468.1893972843885,
      "y": 852.249369730644,
      "width": 171.67987060546875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4I",
